{"id":"00301","root":"uni00301_1","name":{"ja":"熱川　るみ","en":"Atagawa Rumi"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"熱川　るみ","en":"Atagawa Rumi"},"element":"Natural","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-02-29","limited":false,"characterId":208,"profile":{"ja":"学生対魔忍。超高温の水蒸気を操る忍法を使う。母譲りの水遁の術使いであるが、高温を出せることには父が火遁使いであることが関係しているのではないかと言われる。特殊な水鉄砲から蒸気圧による高圧水流を放って敵を攻撃し、五車学園内でも前線で戦えるアタッカー候補として大いに期待されている。性格は明るく前向きで、少し子供っぽいものの、対魔忍としての務めを果たせる様になろうと日夜頑張る努力家。だが、非常に恥ずかしがり屋かつ上がり症なので、注目されたり褒められたりする事は苦手。緊張や羞恥が高まると頭から蒸気を噴いてしまう体質を嫌がっているが、友人たちからは「可愛い」と言われて評判は悪くない。","en":"Atagawa Rumi is a student Taimanin who wields a ninja art that manipulates super-hot steam. She inherited water-style techniques from her mother, and it's rumored her father's fire-style abilities enable her to generate such high temperatures. She fires high-pressure water streams generated by steam pressure from a special water gun, making her a promising frontline attacker at Gosha Academy. Her personality is bright and optimistic; she's a bit childlike but works tirelessly day and night to fulfill her duties as a Taimanin. However, she's extremely shy and suffers from stage fright, so she dislikes being the center of attention or receiving praise. When her nerves or embarrassment spike, she involuntarily erupts steam from her head—a trait she loathes, though friends call her \"cute,\" keeping her reputation solid."},"illustrator":"さくらんぼ","voiceActor":"麻優莉","forms":[{"id":"uni00301_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1036,2072],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[137,274],"def":[119,238],"spd":[64,64],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["4","490007"]},{"id":"uni00301_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1572,3144],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[209,418],"def":[173,346],"spd":[64,64],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["4","490007","490008"]},{"id":"uni00301_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2108,4211],"sp":[320,320],"atk"